```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
  participant U as "User"
  participant API as "API"
  participant INV as "InventoryDB"
  participant Stripe as "Stripe API"
  participant DB as "MainDB"

  U->>API: "POST /checkout"
  API->>INV: "Check stock"
  alt "Items available"
    API->>Stripe: "Process payment"
    Stripe-->>API: "Payment success"
    API->>DB: "Record order"
    API-->>U: "Payment Confirmed"
  else "Out of stock"
    API-->>U: "Out of stock"
  end
```

Chosen diagram: sequenceDiagram (time-ordered interactions across systems).
